# DsTable docs snippets

## Reorderable

### Show code
<DsTable
  bordered
  columns={[
    {
      accessorKey: 'firstName',
      cell: () => {},
      header: 'First Name'
    },
    {
      accessorKey: 'lastName',
      cell: () => {},
      header: 'Last Name'
    },
    {
      accessorKey: 'age',
      cell: () => {},
      header: 'Age'
    },
    {
      accessorKey: 'visits',
      cell: () => {},
      header: 'Visits'
    },
    {
      accessorKey: 'status',
      cell: () => {},
      header: 'Status'
    },
    {
      accessorKey: 'progress',
      cell: () => {},
      header: 'Profile Progress'
